flowchart TD
  Need[New business fact?] --> Q1{Many instances with own lifecycle?}
  Q1 -->|Yes, no standard fit| Cust[Custom object plus fields]
  Q1 -->|Yes, standard fits| Std[Reuse standard object]
  Q1 -->|One fact on existing thing| Fld[Field on that object]
  Need --> Q2{Saved occurrence or definition?}
  Q2 -->|One real inspection| Rec[Create a record]
  Q2 -->|Allowed Status values| Meta[Change field metadata]
  Need --> Q3{Users cannot see Amount?}
  Q3 -->|Object opens, field hidden| Acc[Field access or layout, not missing object]
